TokenBudget controls how much of the context window the agent is allowed to use for the conversation history: TokenBudget { context_window: 32768, // total window size completion_reserve: 4096, // reserved for the model's reply
}
// prompt_budget() = context_window - completion_reserve = 28672 The completion_reserve ensures the model always has room to generate a reply. The prompt_budget() is the hard limit on how many tokens of conversation history are sent.

